# Documentation

Documentation must match actual implementation.

Label capabilities as:

IMPLEMENTED
EXPERIMENTAL
PLANNED
SIMULATED

Do not describe planned functionality as implemented.

## Security Frameworks

Use only verified mappings.

Potential frameworks:

NIST AI RMF
NIST SP 800-171 Rev. 3
NIST SP 800-171A Rev. 3
NIST SP 800-53 where relevant
MITRE ATLAS
OWASP LLM Top 10
OWASP Agentic Security guidance
CSA MAESTRO

Do not use NIST SP 800-17 for AgentSec security mapping.

For every mapping document:

framework
requirement/control identifier
official title
why it applies
AgentSec invariant
AgentSec test
evidence
reference

Framework mapping does not mean certification or compliance.
